{
  "0": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_SEQ_00",
    "original": "Trachraet would commend you for your work among the disparate societies of Eorzea, and entreat your further aid.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "1": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_SEQ_01",
    "original": "Lieutenant Trachraet expresses his gratitude for your accomplishments, which have laid the groundwork upon which enduring peace with the beast tribes of Eorzea may one day be achieved. Valuing your diplomatic skills highly, he would seek your aid with an important task. Inquire with Lieutenant Gavin of Gridania\u0027s Order of the Twin Adder as to the details.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "2": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_SEQ_02",
    "original": "Lieutenant Gavin is heartened by your presence, having heard much of your peace-building exploits with the beast tribes. To learn more of the task the Twin Adder would entrust to you, speak with the lieutenant anew.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "24": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_TODO_00",
    "original": "Speak with Gavin at the Adders\u0027 Nest in Gridania.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "48": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_TRACHRAET_000_000",
    "original": "Ah, \u003Chex:\u003E. Ye\u0027ve done the realm a great service. On behalf of all the Maelstrom, ye \u0027ave me gratitude.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "49": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_TRACHRAET_000_001",
    "original": "There was a time when even mentionin\u0027 the notion of peace with the beastmen would\u0027ve gotten ye laughed out o\u0027 Limsa\u2500but no more. Yer efforts \u0027ave opened avenues once thought impossible.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "50": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_TRACHRAET_000_002",
    "original": "...And ye couldn\u0027t \u0027ave come at a better time. We\u0027ve received an urgent call for aid from the Order of the Twin Adder. It would seem your services are required in Gridania.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "51": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_TRACHRAET_000_003",
    "original": "One Lieutenant Gavin will brief you on the particulars upon your arrival at the Adders\u0027 Nest. Godsspeed, \u003Chex:\u003E, and may Llymlaen guide ye.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "52": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_TRACHRAET_000_004",
    "original": "Your services are required in Gridania, \u003Chex:\u003E. Godsspeed, and may Llymlaen guide ye.",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "53": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_GAVIN_000_010",
    "original": "\u003Chex:\u003E! What I\u0027d not give to hear of your adventures with the Ixal over a flagon of mead!",
    "translation": ""
  },
  "54": {
    "tag": "TEXT_BANALL011_01466_GAVIN_000_011",
    "original": "...And yet I fear that more pressing matters demand our attention today. When you are ready for your briefing, you need only say the word.",
    "translation": ""
  }
}